User asked whether git-refs could replace the deliberately-untracked K3 pin
and whether that lets things collapse, with a TODO to revert after K3 reaches
a supported release. Collapse of the matrix is impossible either way (branch
vs release, torch 2.13 vs 2.11, flashinfer versions); what collapses is the
manual re-pin workflow.

## Actions
Rewrote the K3 entry comment (git-refs marker + retirement TODO), added a
